+//=======================================================================
+// function : MeasuredEdgeFace
+// purpose  : PARCAD: the least distance PerformEF would have recorded for
+//           the range [theT1, theT2] of an edge it proved clear of a face
+//           instead of intersecting; RealLast() where it would have
